#### inserts elements

- Verify: inserts elements
   - Expected: set.len() equals `3)  # oracle: value fixed by the spec contract`
   - Expected: set contains `apple`
   - Expected: set contains `banana`


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 10 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
step("Verify: inserts elements")
# @req: REQ-FEATURE-HashBasi-001
var set = HashSet.new()
set.insert("apple")
set.insert("banana")
set.insert("cherry")

expect(set.len()).to_equal(3)  # oracle: value fixed by the spec contract
expect(set.contains("apple")).to_equal(true)
expect(set.contains("banana")).to_equal(true)
```

</details>

#### handles duplicate insertions

- Verify: handles duplicate insertions
   - Expected: set.len() equals `2)  # oracle: value fixed by the spec contract`
   - Expected: set contains `cat`
   - Expected: set contains `dog`


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 9 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

